<title>GREECE: BARCLAYS, ATHENS SELLS SHIPPING UNIT TO MIDLAND - SOURCES.</title>
<headline>BARCLAYS, ATHENS SELLS SHIPPING UNIT TO MIDLAND - SOURCES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Bank, Athens sold its shipping unit to Midland Bank, Athens on Friday, bank sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>Barclays and Midland Bank officials were unavailable for comment. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
